<headroom-library version="1" id="bl-one-finger-orchestra" category="Guitar + MIDI" order="50" instrument="guitar" style="Extended Harmony">
  <description>Play one note and hear the whole chord on its scale degree, extended to the 11th, walked by a string machine and your own strings. Play a melody and the harmony follows it through the key; play full chords and it voices them up to the 11th.</description>
  <tags><tag>Bloom</tag><tag>Arpeggio</tag><tag>Clean</tag><tag>Ambient</tag><tag>Strings</tag><tag>Guitar + MIDI</tag><tag>Poly</tag></tags>
